<title>USA: Potomac gets early end to merger wait period.</title>
<headline>Potomac gets early end to merger wait period.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Potomac Electric Power Co said Wednesday it and Baltimore Gas and Electric Co have received permission to go ahead with a proposed merger by federal anti-trust authorities.</p>
<p>The merged company will be called Constellation Energy Corp.</p>
<p>Other proceedings before federal and state agencies are continuing, with approvals received from the Nuclear Regulatory Commission and the Virginia State Corporation Commission. It said completion of the approval process should take until the end of the first quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
